SUMMARY:Schools closed (haze): Johor
DESCRIPTION:All schools and educational institutions throughout Johor.\nHom
 e-based teaching and learning (PdPR) continues.\nPrivate educational insti
 tutions and childcare centres decide for themselves whether to open\; thos
 e that open must operate indoors with face masks.\nLimited exemptions may 
 be considered for students sitting exams or assessments\, coordinated with
  the Johor State Education Department (JPNJ).\nFive more days starting Mon
 day 19 October\, which ends on Friday 23 October. Reopening is reviewed be
 fore then.\nExtends the closure of all Johor schools from 12 to 16 October
 .\nAnnounced by Dr Muhammad Naqib Md Ghazali\, Johor Education and Informa
 tion Committee chairman\, after a meeting of the Johor Haze Management Coo
 rdination Committee on 2026-10-17.\nReported by Bernama: Haze: Schools\, e
 ducational institutions in Johor to close for another five days from Monda
 y https://www.bernama.com/en/general/news.php?id=2621869\nReported by Bern
 ama: Jerebu: Sekolah\, institusi pendidikan Johor ditutup lima hari lagi b
 ermula Isnin https://www.bernama.com/bm/am/news.php?id=2621868\nReported b
 y Bernama: Peperiksaan Sekolah Agama Di Johor Diteruskan Mengikut Jadual -
  JAINJ https://www.bernama.com/bm/am/news.php?id=2622007\nFrom the IPU Mal
 aysia dashboard (independent\, not an official service): https://ashraviin
 rajthinagaraj.github.io/malaysia-ipu/
